    lsm:documentation "A data type of Sequence Number SHOULD identify a number value that is a position in a series of positive whole numbers with a maximum value of 2147483647. It SHALL NOT contain any punctuation. EXAMPLE: A Sequence Number for the second occurrence of a VIEW container would be expressed as \"2\"." ;
